<title>UK: Stagecoach reverses on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Stagecoach reverses on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK transport business Stagecoach Holdings Plc went into reverse on Tuesday on a round of profit taking, analysts said.</p>
<p>The shares had slipped 6p to 731p by 1105 GMT after opening 20.5p higher as annual profits almost trebled.</p>
<p>Analysts said there were signs of profit taking following gains on Monday ahead of the results.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
